so we will also need to upgrade that to lenny's version of aboot,  
which I believe already has the fixes described in:

http://lkml.org/lkml/2007/8/14/259

does it not?

Anyway, I've been having trouble building this version of aboot on  
etch.  It looks like some problems with linux-kernel-headers:

