ling with symbolic links wrong from root but all symbolic links must be i=
n "/boot/"  on a typical etch install and /boot is a separate ext2 partit=
ion with a separate "/boot/etc/aboot.conf".

/dev/sda3              5156060    633116   4522944  13% /
tmpfs                    60464         0     60464   0% /lib/init/rw
